msgid "`[ENTRY, attrgrp0, attrgrp1, ...]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../BitCodeFormat.md:856
msgid ""
"The `ENTRY` record (code 2) contains a variable number of values describing "
"a unique set of function parameter attributes. Each *attrgrp* value is used "
"as a key with which to look up an entry in the attribute group table "
"described in the `PARAMATTR_GROUP_BLOCK` block."
